      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div id=\"toggleBtnTop\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 0; display: inline-block; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">\n  Know More\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"faqs\" style=\"padding:15px 0; display:none; background: transparent; border:none;\">\n\n  <style>\n    #faqs h2 {\n      font-size: 1.25rem !important; /* 缩小标题，使其与正文比例更协调 */\n      margin-top: 1.5rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.3 !important;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs p, #faqs li {\n      font-size: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.6 !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n    }\n    #faqs table td {\n      padding: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h2>1. Choosing the Right Dimmer Switch</h2>\n  <p>Not all dimmers are compatible with every bulb. Matching the wrong switch with your lighting can lead to flickering or buzzing.</p>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>LED Dimmer Switches:</b> Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\">standard dimmer modules</a> are specifically engineered for low-wattage LEDs.</li>\n    <li><b>Designer Collections:</b> Explore our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-brass-series\" target=\"_blank\">Solid Brass</a> and <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\">Solid Steel</a> series.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>2. Specialized & Professional Dimming</h2>\n  <p>Based on high-intent search trends, specialized DC and 0-10V systems are crucial for modern installations.</p>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Commercial Systems:</b> Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/0-10v-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\">0-10V Dimmer Series</a> offers precise control for drivers.</li>\n    <li><b>Retractive Switching:</b> For push-to-dim functionality, see our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-for-retractive-switch\" target=\"_blank\">Smart Dimmer</a>.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>3. Smart Home Integration</h2>\n  <p>The future of lighting is connected. Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/dimmer-switch\" target=\"_blank\">Smart Dimmer Collection</a> integrates with your hub for voice control.</p>\n\n  <div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"text-align:left; background: #fafafa;\">\n          <td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Standard</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Smart</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Control</b></td>\n          <td>Manual</td>\n          <td>App & Voice</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Product</b></td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\">Module</a></td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\">Smart</a></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>4. Multi-Way Dimming Solutions</h2>\n  <p>For hallways or large rooms, our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-brass\" target=\"_blank\">Multiway Dimmer Series</a> is the perfect solution, available in Brass, Steel, and White.</p>\n\n  <h2 style=\"border-top: 1px solid #eee; pt-4; padding-top: 20px;\">FAQs</h2>\n  <p><strong>Can I use a normal dimmer with LED bulbs?</strong><br>\n  No, you should always use a dedicated <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\">LED Dimmer Module</a> to ensure smooth performance.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Do you offer \"Dummy\" dimmers?</strong><br>\n  Yes, we provide <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dummy-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\">Dummy Dimmer Switches</a> for a consistent look without dimming functions.</p>\n\n  <div id=\"toggleBtnBottom\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 0; display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px;\">\n    Show Less\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function toggleFaq() {\n    const content = document.getElementById('faqs');\n    const topBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtnTop');\n\n    if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n      content.style.display = \"block\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      content.style.display = \"none\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n      // 平滑滚动回顶部\n      window.scrollTo({ top: topBtn.offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    }\n  }\n</script>",
